# Relic art generation request — change a value + push to main to fire the
# `relic art` workflow (generates via Flux on GitHub's runners). Bump `nonce`
# to re-fire with the same params.
#
# STYLE SWEEP: set `styles=` (space-separated registers) to generate each relic
# once per register and push a relics × styles comparison sheet to the
# `relic-style-test` branch (no bake). Leave `styles=` EMPTY to bake+ship with
# the default register (flat) to the `relic-art` branch instead.
#
# TARGETED RE-ROLL: list only the relic ids to redo. The bake seeds the rest of
# the set from the relic-art branch first, so only these are overwritten.
relics=ysolde-tourniquet maren-milk-tooth cael-black-poultice cael-grave-earth ring-of-ember martyrs-tallow vess-last-wick jeweler-band morningstar-chip ring-of-fury bloodbond-ring
styles=
candidates=1
promote_and_bake=true
nonce=8
